{
  "info": {
    "name": "SportsBooks — Venue Booking Lobby Flow",
    "description": "## Matchmaking Lobby Booking Flow\n\nTests the full venue booking lobby lifecycle including:\n- Creating lobbies (split, creator_pays, split_to_teams)\n- Joining/leaving lobbies\n- Team management (join team, leave team, add team)\n- Editing lobbies (title, description, payment type)\n- Creating booking from lobby\n- Partner approval\n- Split payments and confirmation\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Backend running on `localhost:3000`\n- `DEV_AUTH_BYPASS=true` in `.env`\n- PostgreSQL running with migrations applied\n- Test users exist: `test-player-uid-1` (Ana), `test-player-bob` (Bob), `test-player-ana` (Ana Test)\n- Test venue with available time slots\n\n### How to Run\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Click **▶ Run Collection**\n3. Requests auto-chain via `postman.setNextRequest()`",
    "_postman_id": "c2d3e4f5-6789-abcd-ef01-234567890abc",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api" },
    { "key": "player1_token", "value": "test-player-uid-1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "player2_token", "value": "test-player-bob", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "player3_token", "value": "test-player-ana", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "partner_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "lobby_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "lobby_id_split", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "lobby_id_creator_pays", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "booking_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "team1_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "team2_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "time_slot_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "time_slot_id_2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "time_slot_id_3", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "venue_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
